    "sentence_translations": [
      "Finally there's something you can't do",
      "",
      "Little Ming's desk-mate Da Wei is a top student.",
      "Da Wei usually doesn't like to talk, and starts to write as soon as he picks up the homework.",
      "Often Little Ming has not finished a single problem when Da Wei finishes the assignment and hands it to the teacher.",
      "Little Ming really doesn't like that Da Wei does the assignments so quickly.",
      "",
      "Finally one time, Da Wei looked at the assignment for a long time without saying or writing anything.",
      "Little Ming was happy, and said laughing: “Haha, finally there's an assignment you can't do!”",
      "Da Wei looked at Little Ming and said: “It's not that I can't do it, it's that my pen doesn't have any ink.”"
    ]
  }
